WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:27.850 --> 01:29.930
I cannot allow you
to go any further.

01:38.900 --> 01:39.900
Chocolat,

01:40.530 --> 01:43.570
do not underestimate the
power of the Ogres.

01:44.070 --> 01:46.750
Go ahead, defeat me now!

01:47.240 --> 01:49.910
If you don't, who knows
what I'll do...

01:55.750 --> 01:56.970
I just can't do it.

01:58.290 --> 02:00.090
That person...

02:00.090 --> 02:01.800
The Grand Duke of Darkness...

02:01.800 --> 02:03.630
is afraid of the two of you.

02:05.010 --> 02:08.260
Continue with the Queen Exam.

02:09.300 --> 02:13.600
That might be the only way
to save the Magical World.

02:17.560 --> 02:20.360
You two have committed
a grave crime.

02:21.480 --> 02:25.400
These Noir spears have disrupted
the balance of the mountain!

02:26.330 --> 02:29.950
I doubt the unicorn
will show itself now.

02:47.470 --> 02:51.020
The Unicorn's Trial,
Test of the Heart.

02:58.520 --> 03:00.810
What a pretty light.

03:00.810 --> 03:04.020
It's filling me with happiness
and warmth.

03:05.280 --> 03:07.990
Just looking at it sets
my heart at ease.

03:18.000 --> 03:19.540
The unicorn?!

03:19.540 --> 03:21.100
That boy was really the unicorn?

03:25.920 --> 03:27.420
Amazing...

03:27.420 --> 03:28.600
It's so beautiful.

03:34.350 --> 03:38.110
Welcome, you who are undergoing
the Queen Exam.

03:39.480 --> 03:41.110
He's talking to me in my head.

03:41.110 --> 03:46.160
I will now ascertain which one
of you is fit to be Queen.

03:47.280 --> 03:49.870
But we're here to take your horn.

03:50.280 --> 03:53.370
I will present you with three trials.

03:53.870 --> 03:57.620
If you can clear all three,
I will give you my horn.

03:58.410 --> 04:02.330
They are: Truth-Discerning Eyes,

04:02.330 --> 04:05.290
Wings of Courage and Clarity,

04:05.290 --> 04:07.890
and Heart of Pure Love.

04:07.890 --> 04:10.090
Truth-Discerning Eyes,

04:10.090 --> 04:12.880
Wings of Courage and Clarity,

04:13.900 --> 04:17.260
and Heart of Pure Love

04:17.810 --> 04:22.060
Those who possess all three
may enter my soul...

04:22.060 --> 04:24.980
and take my horn.

04:26.270 --> 04:28.410
The Unicorn's horn...

04:28.410 --> 04:31.410
whoever takes it gets to be Queen.

04:36.160 --> 04:38.750
Vanilla, the unicorn's calling us.

04:39.040 --> 04:41.260
Our last test is beginning!

04:41.710 --> 04:42.760
Yeah.

04:45.260 --> 04:47.210
C'mon, it's a race to see...

04:47.210 --> 04:49.880
who can get
the unicorn's horn first.

04:49.880 --> 04:52.270
Let's do our very best
till the very end!

04:52.880 --> 04:56.640
A lot of things have happened,
but now the matter will be decided.

04:57.100 --> 05:00.810
Either Chocolat-chan
or I will become Queen.

05:02.980 --> 05:04.780
Best of luck to us both.

05:04.780 --> 05:07.820
Right! Now, after that unicorn!

05:07.820 --> 05:08.650
Yeah.

05:13.700 --> 05:16.230
Wait for us, unicorn!

05:16.230 --> 05:19.200
I'll get that horn,
come hell or high water!

05:25.880 --> 05:29.880
I will now determine which
of you has the eyes...

05:29.880 --> 05:32.010
that can discern truth.

05:34.010 --> 05:35.260
That light's so bright!

05:35.260 --> 05:36.440
It's dazzling...

05:38.390 --> 05:39.940
Multiple unicorns?

05:40.310 --> 05:42.560
If you truly have
Truth-Discerning Eyes,

05:42.560 --> 05:44.440
then you should be able
to find the real me.

05:46.770 --> 05:49.860
What do we do?
They all look the same.

05:50.480 --> 05:53.360
Still, one of them's gotta
be the real thing.

05:53.960 --> 05:56.240
Rouge Ruban.

05:58.820 --> 06:00.960
All right, I'll start with that one!

06:01.290 --> 06:02.910
Ready...

06:03.700 --> 06:04.410
Go!

06:06.460 --> 06:07.470
Got it!

06:09.250 --> 06:10.430
It disappeared?

06:10.430 --> 06:13.340
Too bad. On to the next one!

06:18.390 --> 06:20.440
That one was wrong too.

06:20.440 --> 06:23.360
The more I can't have something,

06:23.360 --> 06:25.990
the more I want it!

06:25.990 --> 06:28.400
Onward and upward!

06:30.820 --> 06:32.410
I have to get going too.

06:35.990 --> 06:38.070
Which one's the real one?

07:09.150 --> 07:09.950
That's...

07:10.560 --> 07:12.020
What the heck is that?

07:12.610 --> 07:13.450
The Ogres!

07:13.820 --> 07:16.190
Shoot, they're
heading for Le Palais!

07:16.690 --> 07:17.940
The Ogres are?

07:18.530 --> 07:22.320
The Grand Duke of Darkness,
Glace, is about to be revived.

07:22.870 --> 07:24.410
The scent of cinnamon?

07:25.830 --> 07:27.950
But there is still hope.

07:28.620 --> 07:30.930
Don't give up until the very end!

07:31.460 --> 07:33.420
Glace will be revived?

07:33.420 --> 07:35.930
So that's the Ogres' goal?

07:36.340 --> 07:38.630
I'm going back to Le Palais.

07:38.630 --> 07:40.430
You wait here for those two.

07:40.760 --> 07:42.550
You just want us to wait?

07:42.550 --> 07:43.760
Saule...

07:47.980 --> 07:49.950
All right, Robin-sensei.

07:50.310 --> 07:51.900
I'm counting on you.

07:53.150 --> 07:56.570
The one who saved us
at Pierre's mansion...

07:56.570 --> 07:58.360
must've been...

07:59.650 --> 08:01.610
Wait up!

08:05.630 --> 08:07.170
Missed him again.

08:10.200 --> 08:11.420
It's hopeless.

08:11.420 --> 08:15.790
I can't tell which one's real
just by looking at them.

08:15.790 --> 08:19.930
What can I do to find
the real unicorn?

08:20.880 --> 08:24.090
Earlier, when we first
saw the unicorn,

08:24.090 --> 08:26.800
it was emitting a light that
put my heart at ease.

08:27.560 --> 08:29.930
If I find that light again,

08:29.930 --> 08:32.440
I'll find the real unicorn.

08:43.990 --> 08:45.170
Is it you?

08:46.900 --> 08:48.900
Caught you!

08:54.380 --> 08:58.220
You've done well to catch me with
your Truth-Discerning Eyes.

09:00.630 --> 09:02.510
You did it, Vanilla!

09:02.510 --> 09:03.840
Chocolat-chan...

09:03.840 --> 09:06.270
Did you use magic to focus
your consciousness?

09:06.850 --> 09:08.100
I don't know how I did it...

09:08.100 --> 09:11.600
but I desperately tried to focus
on finding the real one,

09:11.600 --> 09:13.240
and saw a gentle light.

09:13.240 --> 09:17.770
It's amazing that you can do
something like that, Vanilla!

09:17.770 --> 09:21.320
I flew all over the place, but all
the ones I caught were fakes.

09:22.000 --> 09:24.500
I will rise again in the next round!

09:33.020 --> 09:37.040
The Ogres' dark aura has
surrounded Le Palais.

09:37.040 --> 09:39.750
They intend to attack Le Palais.

09:39.750 --> 09:40.710
Let's take them on!

09:42.260 --> 09:43.260
No.

09:43.260 --> 09:46.220
We must not make the first strike.

09:46.720 --> 09:51.770
The Queen Exam is under way, and we cannot do anything to interrupt it.

10:00.480 --> 10:03.050
Glace-sama's resurrection is nigh.

10:03.050 --> 10:08.290
Now is the time for us Ogres and our Noir
to bring down Le Royaume!

10:15.290 --> 10:17.000
What a terrible blizzard.

10:17.000 --> 10:18.380
I can barely stand!

10:18.380 --> 10:19.670
Stay strong, Vanilla!

10:19.670 --> 10:20.800
Okay.

10:25.300 --> 10:27.840
The second trial is on its way.

10:27.840 --> 10:28.310
Yeah.

10:28.840 --> 10:31.600
This is the Valley of Obstruction.

10:32.140 --> 10:34.270
I will now determine
which of you has...

10:34.270 --> 10:38.320
the Wings of Courage and Clarity.

10:38.980 --> 10:41.150
Of all the Mages living
in the Magical World,

10:41.150 --> 10:43.290
not one has ever
jumped across this valley.

10:43.860 --> 10:45.690
If you jump,

10:45.690 --> 10:48.330
you may find yourself sucked
into a deadly abyss.

10:50.830 --> 10:52.580
Even so, will you jump?

11:07.800 --> 11:08.840
I'm scared...

11:08.840 --> 11:10.760
I can't see a thing in this blizzard.

11:13.970 --> 11:16.020
Even Chocolat-chan's shaking.

11:16.020 --> 11:17.990
She must really be scared.

11:18.600 --> 11:20.560
I'm taking a leap of faith.

11:21.400 --> 11:25.200
I just lost the last trial to you,
so I've got no choice.

11:25.570 --> 11:29.730
B-But... shouldn't you wait until
the blizzard dies down a bit?

11:29.730 --> 11:32.570
No, there's no "later" for me.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.240
Chocolat-chan...

11:34.990 --> 11:36.750
All I can do is jump.

11:36.750 --> 11:39.290
I'm scared because I
can't see anything,

11:39.290 --> 11:42.500
but there might be even scarier things
waiting for me down there.

11:42.500 --> 11:45.250
I believe I can fly.
Nothing left but to jump.

11:45.750 --> 11:47.380
I'm heading out, Vanilla.

11:47.380 --> 11:48.760
Chocolat-chan!

11:54.100 --> 11:56.760
This wind...
it's blowing me back!

11:57.350 --> 11:59.600
I can't even see the other side,

11:59.600 --> 12:01.810
so how far should I fly?

12:05.230 --> 12:06.570
I... can't... lose!

12:12.640 --> 12:14.480
No way! An ice dragon?

12:21.420 --> 12:23.460
What now? It's scary...

12:23.460 --> 12:25.090
but I have to jump.

12:25.090 --> 12:27.550
If Chocolat-chan can do it, so can I!

12:40.170 --> 12:41.360
A dragon?

12:46.190 --> 12:47.570
Vanilla!

12:48.980 --> 12:50.240
Chocolat-chan?

12:50.240 --> 12:52.530
My body's so frozen
that I can't move.

12:52.530 --> 12:54.160
Go on ahead.

12:55.370 --> 12:58.340
Get out of here, Vanilla!
It'll freeze you too!

12:59.540 --> 13:02.290
If only I could use my
wand, I'd show him...

13:02.290 --> 13:02.840
Just a moment!

13:06.130 --> 13:07.460
Vanilla?

13:12.430 --> 13:13.550
There we go!

13:14.050 --> 13:16.340
Brille Etoile!

13:22.770 --> 13:24.730
Incredible, Chocolat-chan!

13:24.730 --> 13:27.650
You defeated the dragon
with magical light.

13:27.650 --> 13:28.270
Yeah.

13:28.940 --> 13:30.820
I figured it was worth a shot.

13:31.320 --> 13:33.610
But I couldn't have done
it without your help.

13:33.610 --> 13:34.290
Yeah.

13:36.410 --> 13:38.820
Look! It's super-pretty!

13:44.300 --> 13:46.580
All right!
We've crossed the valley!

13:46.580 --> 13:47.340
We sure have!

13:51.170 --> 13:52.510
The unicorn...

13:53.340 --> 13:56.720
If you have the
Wings of Courage and Clarity,

13:56.720 --> 13:58.600
the path will surely open for you.

13:58.600 --> 14:00.720
So I guess that one was a tie.

14:00.720 --> 14:01.720
But...

14:01.720 --> 14:03.610
There's one trial left.

14:04.430 --> 14:07.060
The  "Heart of Pure Love,'' right?

14:13.070 --> 14:16.200
The castle is being
corroded by Noir.

14:16.200 --> 14:18.450
Le Palais won't hold
out if this continues.

14:18.450 --> 14:20.070
Give us the order to attack!

14:20.830 --> 14:22.280
We will endure it.

14:22.790 --> 14:25.370
A pre-emptive strike
can only end in...

14:25.370 --> 14:28.630
an all-out war between
us and the Ogres.

14:28.630 --> 14:31.090
We must avoid that at all costs.

14:35.140 --> 14:39.220
The final trial will take place in
the lowest depths of this valley.

14:44.980 --> 14:46.350
Looks deep...

14:46.350 --> 14:48.150
It's pitch-black,
I can't see a thing.

14:48.600 --> 14:52.110
Can you save me from
that deep darkness?

14:52.650 --> 14:55.610
Everything hinges on the
Heart of Pure Love.

14:56.280 --> 14:57.610
I'll be waiting.

15:03.790 --> 15:04.870
Chocolat-chan?

15:05.580 --> 15:08.670
We may laugh, we may cry,
it all ends here.

15:08.670 --> 15:10.330
So let's go there together,

15:10.330 --> 15:12.380
holding hands like we always do.

15:12.380 --> 15:13.590
Yeah!

15:15.920 --> 15:17.590
Dive!

15:18.880 --> 15:20.640
It's getting hot in here!

15:23.100 --> 15:24.140
What's this?

15:26.560 --> 15:28.600
Whoa! Stop, stop!

15:35.280 --> 15:36.110
Ow ow...

15:36.990 --> 15:38.650
It's so hot...

15:39.110 --> 15:41.700
If we fell into that magma,

15:41.700 --> 15:43.950
we'd get roasted to the bone.

15:43.950 --> 15:46.170
Seek me out.

15:46.170 --> 15:47.540
Where?

15:47.540 --> 15:48.620
Where is he?

15:49.410 --> 15:51.710
Here. I am right over here.

15:52.880 --> 15:54.040
That way!

15:54.040 --> 15:54.790
Yeah.

16:08.680 --> 16:09.640
Bats?

16:14.610 --> 16:16.190
Noo!

16:16.190 --> 16:18.610
So what? I love bats!

16:20.530 --> 16:21.130
Wha?

16:24.530 --> 16:27.280
What do we do?
What can we do?

16:27.910 --> 16:30.130
Where the hell is that unicorn??

16:31.250 --> 16:34.380
Here. I am right over here.

16:34.380 --> 16:36.130
This way. Come!

16:36.130 --> 16:37.210
That way!

16:37.210 --> 16:38.090
Yeah!

16:38.840 --> 16:40.470
This way.

16:40.470 --> 16:42.090
Not that way?

16:42.090 --> 16:44.130
Wrong. This way.

16:44.800 --> 16:45.650
Which way?

16:45.970 --> 16:48.900
Where are you, unicorn??

16:49.270 --> 16:50.850
It's hopeless.

16:50.850 --> 16:54.600
His voice has been coming from
all different directions.

16:54.600 --> 16:57.730
It must be echoing off the walls.

16:57.730 --> 17:00.370
So just following the
voice is pointless.

17:00.650 --> 17:01.690
What's wrong?

17:01.690 --> 17:03.950
I'm right over here. This way.

17:05.950 --> 17:06.910
There he is!

17:10.040 --> 17:10.620
Wait!

17:13.410 --> 17:15.080
We have to go through that?

17:15.580 --> 17:16.640
It can't be...

17:17.000 --> 17:20.850
All right, if the unicorn can
get through there, so can I!

17:25.130 --> 17:26.390
Here goes...

17:29.400 --> 17:30.860
Vanilla!

17:34.400 --> 17:36.070
Vanilla, look out!

17:36.810 --> 17:39.570
Vanilla, take my hand!
This way!

17:40.360 --> 17:42.070
Chocolat-chan...

17:44.080 --> 17:45.400
Here we go.

17:47.620 --> 17:49.620
That was a close one.

17:50.660 --> 17:51.870
What is it?

17:54.290 --> 17:56.540
What's wrong?
Did you get hurt somewhere?

17:57.170 --> 17:59.880
It's not... It's not that,
Chocolat-chan.

18:00.960 --> 18:02.590
Queen Candidates.

18:03.100 --> 18:05.090
Here I am.

18:05.090 --> 18:06.680
Can you reach me?

18:23.190 --> 18:24.650
Let's go, Vanilla!

18:26.700 --> 18:29.120
Chocolat-chan, you go on.

18:29.120 --> 18:30.920
Vanilla, your leg...

18:30.920 --> 18:32.830
I was scared...

18:32.830 --> 18:34.910
I thought I was done for...

18:34.910 --> 18:37.420
But you saved me,

18:38.250 --> 18:41.170
even though you were
in pain as well.

18:41.790 --> 18:44.420
That's why you should go
first, Chocolat-chan!

18:44.420 --> 18:46.970
You'll reach the unicorn
in no time if you fly.

18:47.970 --> 18:49.440
Vanilla...

18:49.800 --> 18:52.440
I can't fly with my leg like this.

18:59.980 --> 19:01.610
Chocolat-chan...

19:01.610 --> 19:06.260
My magic's not good enough
to pick you up and fly.

19:06.260 --> 19:08.200
But I can still walk.

19:08.200 --> 19:10.500
Besides, you saved me
not too long ago.

19:10.870 --> 19:12.080
Chocolat-chan...

19:12.080 --> 19:13.530
Let's go, Vanilla.

19:13.530 --> 19:14.460
Sure.

19:41.440 --> 19:42.650
Vanilla!

19:43.960 --> 19:45.960
Chocolat-chan!

19:45.960 --> 19:48.470
Vanilla, hold on tight!

19:48.470 --> 19:51.700
At this rate, we'll both fall!

19:51.700 --> 19:54.210
Let go of my hand,
Chocolat-chan!

19:54.210 --> 19:56.670
I could never do that.

19:56.670 --> 20:01.210
I always wanted to be Queen
because Mama couldn't.

20:01.210 --> 20:05.750
But I don't want to be a Queen
that can't protect you, Vanilla!

20:05.750 --> 20:08.090
Let's go back to Le Palais together.

20:08.090 --> 20:10.010
No matter what happens,

20:10.010 --> 20:11.920
I won't let go of this hand!

20:17.690 --> 20:19.430
Whoa, it's been healed.

20:22.560 --> 20:24.610
Chocolat-chan, I can fly!

20:24.610 --> 20:25.940
Vanilla!

20:26.310 --> 20:30.320
Chocolat-chan, I just felt
a most gentle light.

20:30.320 --> 20:33.780
Yeah! The unicorn
must've saved you.

20:33.780 --> 20:34.710
Let's go.

20:35.950 --> 20:37.290
Unicorn!

20:37.290 --> 20:38.210
Thank you.

20:38.540 --> 20:40.080
Queen Candidates...

20:40.080 --> 20:43.710
Unfortunately, I cannot give
my horn to either of you.

20:44.580 --> 20:45.420
Why?

20:46.500 --> 20:48.170
Hey, wait!

20:48.680 --> 20:51.460
The two of you cannot save
the Magical World.

20:51.460 --> 20:52.680
No way...

20:52.680 --> 20:54.270
Why the sudden reversal?

20:59.140 --> 21:00.560
Just take a look at this.

21:06.270 --> 21:09.520
The Magical World is already
suffused with Noir.

21:10.280 --> 21:12.490
Le Royaume may collapse.

21:12.950 --> 21:16.290
There is no longer any
need for a new Queen.

21:16.620 --> 21:17.950
It is as he says.

21:22.660 --> 21:23.550
Pierre.

21:24.170 --> 21:25.050
What's going on?

21:25.050 --> 21:26.060
Don't move.

21:29.250 --> 21:30.630
Pierre!

21:40.060 --> 21:42.770
Who... Who are you?

21:42.770 --> 21:44.580
Not Pierre, that's for sure.

21:55.610 --> 21:57.210
My name is Glace.

21:57.820 --> 21:59.200
Glace?

22:00.030 --> 22:02.790
The man who created
the Magical World?

22:02.790 --> 22:04.580
Indeed, I am...

22:04.580 --> 22:06.770
the King of the Magical World...

22:07.210 --> 22:09.170
and its conqueror.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:46.600 --> 23:49.150
Chocolat-chan, good work
this past year.

23:49.150 --> 23:50.830
You didn't do so bad
yourself, Vanilla.

23:50.830 --> 23:52.530
